[{"id":"05910053","s":"x＝－3，y＝1為下列哪一個二元一次方程式的解？【105年會考】","o":["x＋2y＝－1","x－2y＝1","2x＋3y＝6","2x－3y＝－6"],"a":0,"e":"將x＝－3，y＝1代入下列各式<br>(Ａ)（－3）＋2×1＝－1<br>(Ｂ)（－3）－2×1＝－5≠1<br>(Ｃ)2×（－3）＋3×1＝－3≠6<br>(Ｄ)2×（－3）－3×1＝－9≠6","k":["105年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910054","s":"算式〔－5－（－11）〕÷（<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r0.svg\" width=\"17\" alt=\"附圖\">×4）之值為何？【105年會考】","o":["1","16","－<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r1.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">","－<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r2.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":0,"e":"原式＝（－5＋11）÷（3×2）＝6÷6＝1","k":["105年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910055","s":"計算（2x＋1）（x－1）－（x<sup>2</sup>＋x－2）的結果，與下列哪一個式子相同？【105年會考】","o":["x<sup>2</sup>－2x＋1","x<sup>2</sup>－2x－3","x<sup>2</sup>＋x－3","x<sup>2</sup>－3"],"a":0,"e":"原式＝（2x<sup>2</sup>－2x＋x－1）－（x<sup>2</sup>＋x－2）<br>＝2x<sup>2</sup>－x－1－x<sup>2</sup>－x＋2<br>＝x<sup>2</sup>－2x＋1","k":["105年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910056","s":"如圖，已知扇形AOB的半徑為10公分，圓心角為54°，則此扇形面積為多少平方公分？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image1.png\" width=\"129\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["100π","20π","15π","5π"],"a":2,"e":"扇形AOB面積＝10×10×π×<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r4.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＝15π（平方公分）","k":["105年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910057","s":"附圖數線上的A、B、C三點所表示的數分別為a、b、c。若｜a－b｜＝3，｜b－c｜＝5，且原點O與A、B的距離分別為4、1，則關於O的位置，下列敘述何者正確？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image2.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"168\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["在A的左邊","介於A、B之間","介於B、C之間","在C的右邊"],"a":2,"e":"∵<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r6.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1<br>∴O點在B點左側1單位處或右側1單位處<br>已知<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r7.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r8.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\">若O點在B點左側1單位處，且｜a－b｜＝3，則<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r9.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3－1＝2（不合）；<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r10.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\">若O點在B點右側1單位處，且｜a－b｜＝3，則<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r11.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3＋1＝4（合）<br>因此O點在B、C之間","k":["105年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910058","s":"多項式77x<sup>2</sup>－13x－30可因式分解成（7x＋a）（bx＋c），其中a、b、c均為整數，求a＋b＋c之值為何？【105年會考】","o":["0","10","12","22"],"a":2,"e":"<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image3.png\" width=\"127\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>利用十字交乘法將77x<sup>2</sup>－13x－30因式分解成（7x－5）（11x＋6）<br>可得a＝－5，b＝11，c＝6<br>∴a＋b＋c＝（－5）＋11＋6＝12","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910059","s":"圖(一)、圖(二)分別為甲、乙兩班學生參加投籃測驗的投進球數長條圖。若甲、乙兩班學生的投進球數的眾數分別為a、b；中位數分別為c、d，則下列關於a、b、c、d的大小關係，何者正確？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image4.png\" width=\"160\" alt=\"附圖\">　<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image5.png\" width=\"160\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["a＞b，c＞d","a＞b，c＜d","a＜b，c＞d","a＜b，c＜d"],"a":0,"e":"由圖(一)、(二)可知a＝8，b＝6　∴a＞b<br>甲班共有5＋15＋20＋15＝55（人）<br>乙班共有25＋5＋15＋10＝55（人）<br>∴甲、乙兩班的中位數落在第28人<br>故c＝8，d＝7　∴c＞d","k":["105年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910060","s":"如圖，有一平行四邊形ABCD與一正方形CEFG，其中E點在<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r15.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">上。若∠ECD＝35°，∠AEF＝15°，則∠B的度數為何？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image6.png\" width=\"160\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["50","55","70","75"],"a":2,"e":"∵∠CED＝180°－∠AEF－∠CEF＝180°－15°－90°＝75°<br>∴∠D＝180°－∠CED－∠ECD＝180°－75°－35°＝70°<br>∵四邊形ABCD為平行四邊形<br>∴∠B＝∠D＝70°","k":["105年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910061","s":"小昱和阿帆均從同一本書的第1頁開始，逐頁依順序在每一頁上寫一個數。小昱在第1頁寫1，且之後每一頁寫的數均為他在前一頁寫的數加2；阿帆在第1頁寫1，且之後每一頁寫的數均為他在前一頁寫的數加7。若小昱在某頁寫的數為101，則阿帆在該頁寫的數為何？【105年會考】","o":["350","351","356","358"],"a":1,"e":"小昱所寫的數為1、3、5、7、…、101、…，阿帆所寫的數為1、8、15、22、…、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r17.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">、…<br>設小昱所寫的第n個數為101<br>101＝1＋（n－1）×2<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r18.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">2（n－1）＝100<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r19.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">n－1＝50<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r20.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">n＝51<br>∴阿帆所寫的第51個數為1＋（51－1）×7＝1＋50×7＝1＋350＝351","k":["105年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910062","s":"甲箱內有4顆球，顏色分別為紅、黃、綠、藍；乙箱內有3顆球，顏色分別為紅、黃、黑。小賴打算同時從甲、乙兩個箱子中各抽出一顆球，若同一箱中每球被抽出的機會相等，則小賴抽出的兩顆球顏色相同的機率為何？【105年會考】","o":["<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r21.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r22.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r23.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r24.svg\" width=\"22\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":1,"e":"將小賴從甲、乙兩箱中抽出球的顏色之所有情形繪成樹狀圖<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image7.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"302\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>抽出的兩顆球顏色相同的只有「都抽出紅球」與「都抽出黃球」2種情形<br>∴同時抽出顏色相同的球之機率為<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r26.svg\" width=\"22\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r27.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910063","s":"坐標平面上有一個二元一次方程式的圖形，此圖形通過（－3 , 0）、（0 , －5）兩點。判斷此圖形與下列哪一個方程式的圖形的交點在第三象限？【105年會考】","o":["x－4＝0","x＋4＝0","y－4＝0","y＋4＝0"],"a":3,"e":"<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image8.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"212\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910064","s":"如圖，△ABC中，D、E兩點分別在<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r29.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r30.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r31.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r32.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r33.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為∠ADE的角平分線。若∠A＝58°，則∠ABD的度數為何？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image9.png\" width=\"151\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["58","59","61","62"],"a":3,"e":"∵<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r35.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為∠ADE的角平分線<br>∴∠1＝∠2………<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r36.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r37.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">是<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r38.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線<br>∴△BDE、△CDE為以<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r39.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為對稱軸之對稱圖形<br>故∠2＝∠3………<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r40.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>由<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r41.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r42.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">可知∠1＝∠2＝∠3<br>又∠1＋∠2＋∠3＝180°<br>故∠1＝∠2＝∠3＝60°，∠4＝∠C＝90°－60°＝30°<br>∴∠ABD＝180°－∠A－∠4－∠C＝180°－58°－30°－30°＝62°<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image10.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910065","s":"若一正方形的面積為20平方公分，周長為x公分，則x的值介於下列哪兩個整數之間？【105年會考】","o":["16，17","17，18","18，19","19，20"],"a":1,"e":"∵周長為x公分　∴邊長為<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r44.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">公分<br>（<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r45.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＝20<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r46.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r47.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝20<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r48.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">x<sup>2</sup>＝320<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r49.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">x＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r50.svg\" width=\"40\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵17<sup>2</sup>＝289，18<sup>2</sup>＝324<br>又17<sup>2</sup>＜（<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r51.svg\" width=\"40\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＜18<sup>2</sup><br>∴17＜<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r52.svg\" width=\"40\" alt=\"附圖\">＜18<br>即17＜x＜18<br>∴x介於17和18之間","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910066","s":"如圖，圓O通過五邊形OABCD的四個頂點。若<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r53.svg\" width=\"35\" alt=\"附圖\">＝150°，∠A＝65°，∠D＝60°，則<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r54.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">的度數為何？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image11.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["25","40","50","55"],"a":1,"e":"連接<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r56.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r57.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>△OAB、△OBC、△OCD皆為等腰三角形<br>∴∠1＝180°－2∠A＝180°－2×65°＝50°，∠2＝180°－2∠D＝180°－2×60°＝60°<br>∵<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r58.svg\" width=\"35\" alt=\"附圖\">＝150°　∴∠AOD＝150°<br>∴∠3＝∠AOD－∠1－∠2＝150°－50°－60°＝40°<br>即<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r59.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">＝40°<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image12.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910067","s":"附圖的六邊形是由甲、乙兩個長方形和丙、丁兩個等腰直角三角形所組成，其中甲、乙的面積和等於丙、丁的面積和。若丙的一股長為2，且丁的面積比丙的面積小，則丁的一股長為何？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image13.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"164\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r62.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r63.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">","2－<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r64.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">","4－2<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r65.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":3,"e":"設丁的一股長為a，且a＜2<br>∵甲面積＋乙面積＝丙面積＋丁面積<br>∴2a＋2a＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r66.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">×2<sup>2</sup>＋<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r67.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">×a<sup>2</sup><br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r68.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">4a＝2＋<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r69.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">a<sup>2</sup><br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r70.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">a<sup>2</sup>－8a＋4＝0<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r71.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">a＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r72.svg\" width=\"144\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r73.svg\" width=\"58\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4±2<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r74.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵4＋2<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r75.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">＞2　∴不合<br>故丁的一股長為4－2<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r76.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910068","s":"附圖的矩形ABCD中，E點在<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r77.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，且<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r78.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r79.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">。若P、Q兩點分別在<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r80.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r81.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r82.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r83.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4：1，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r84.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r85.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4：1，直線PQ交<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r86.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">於R點，且Q、R兩點到<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r87.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的距離分別為q、r，則下列關係何者正確？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image14.png\" width=\"126\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["q＜r，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r89.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r90.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">","q＜r，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r91.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r92.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">","q＝r，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r93.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r94.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">","q＝r，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r95.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r96.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":3,"e":"∵<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r97.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r98.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r99.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r100.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4：1<br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r101.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r102.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，故<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r103.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r104.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r105.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r106.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4：1<br>∵<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r107.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r108.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">兩平行線間的距離相等　∴q＝r<br>又<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r109.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r110.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r111.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r112.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r113.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r114.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r115.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r116.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r117.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image15.png\" width=\"144\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910069","s":"已知a、b、c為三正整數，且a、b的最大公因數為12，a、c的最大公因數為18。若a介於50與100之間，則下列敘述何者正確？【105年會考】","o":["8是a的因數，8是b的因數","8是a的因數，8不是b的因數","8不是a的因數，8是c的因數","8不是a的因數，8不是c的因數"],"a":1,"e":"<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r119.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">∵（a , b）＝12，（a , c）＝18<br>∴a為12與18的公倍數<br>又〔12 , 18〕＝36，且a介於50與100之間<br>故a＝36×2＝72，因此8是a的因數<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r120.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">∵（a , b）＝12＝2<sup>2</sup>×3<br>且a＝72＝2<sup>3</sup>×3<sup>2</sup><br>∴b不可含有因數2<sup>3</sup>＝8<br>因此8不是b的因數<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r121.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">∵（a , c）＝18＝2×3<sup>2</sup><br>且a＝72＝2<sup>3</sup>×3<sup>2</sup><br>∴c不可含有因數2<sup>3</sup>＝8<br>因此8不是c的因數<br>由<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r122.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r123.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r124.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">知選(Ｂ)","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910070","s":"如圖，有一內部裝有水的直圓柱形水桶，桶高20公分；另有一直圓柱形的實心鐵柱，柱高30公分，直立放置於水桶底面上，水桶內的水面高度為12公分，且水桶與鐵柱的底面半徑比為2：1。今小賢將鐵柱移至水桶外部，過程中水桶內的水量未改變，若不計水桶厚度，則水桶內的水面高度變為多少公分？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image16.png\" width=\"139\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["4.5","6","8","9"],"a":3,"e":"∵水桶底面半徑：鐵柱底面半徑＝2：1<br>∴水桶底面積：鐵柱底面積＝2<sup>2</sup>：1<sup>2</sup>＝4：1<br>設鐵柱底面積為A，水桶底面積為4A<br>水桶底面積扣除鐵柱底面積後，所形成的環形區域面積為4A－A＝3A，如圖所示<br>故原有的水量為3A×12＝36A<br>所求＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r126.svg\" width=\"36\" alt=\"附圖\">＝9（公分）<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image17.png\" width=\"107\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910071","s":"附表為小潔打算在某電信公司購買一支MAT手機與搭配一個門號的兩種方案。此公司每個月收取通話費與月租費的方式如下：若通話費超過月租費，只收通話費；若通話費不超過月租費，只收月租費。若小潔每個月的通話費均為x元，x為400到600之間的整數，則在不考慮其他費用並使用兩年的情況下，x至少為多少才會使得選擇乙方案的總花費比甲方案便宜？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image18.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"323\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["500","516","517","600"],"a":2,"e":"∵400＜x＜600<br>∴若小潔選擇甲方案，每月只收通話費<br>若小潔選擇乙方案，每月只收月租費<br>甲方案使用兩年為24x＋15000（元）<br>乙方案使用兩年為24×600＋13000＝27400（元）<br>24x＋15000＞27400<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r129.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">24x＞12400<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r130.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">x＞516<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r131.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>即x至少為517","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910072","s":"如圖，以矩形ABCD的A為圓心，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r132.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">長為半徑畫弧，交<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r133.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">於F點；再以C為圓心，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r134.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">長為半徑畫弧，交<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r135.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">於E點。若<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r136.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r137.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r138.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">，則<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r139.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">的長度為何？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image19.png\" width=\"123\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["2","3","<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r141.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r142.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":0,"e":"連接<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r143.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，則<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r144.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r145.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r146.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵△BCE為直角三角形<br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r147.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r148.svg\" width=\"84\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r149.svg\" width=\"80\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r150.svg\" width=\"36\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r151.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>又<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r152.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r153.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r154.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r155.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">－5＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r156.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r157.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r158.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r159.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r160.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r161.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r162.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image20.png\" width=\"123\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910073","s":"坐標平面上，某二次函數圖形的頂點為（2 , －1），此函數圖形與x軸相交於P、Q兩點，且<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r164.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝6。若此函數圖形通過（1 , a）、（3 , b）、（－1 , c）、（－3 , d）四點，則a、b、c、d之值何者為正？【105年會考】","o":["a","b","c","d"],"a":3,"e":"∵二次函數圖形的頂點為（2 , －1）<br>∴對稱軸為x＝2<br>∵<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r165.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">×<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r166.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r167.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">×6＝3<br>∴二次函數圖形與x軸的交點為（－1 , 0）、（5 , 0）<br>依題意知二次函數圖形通過（2 , －1）、（－1 , 0）、（5 , 0）三點<br>作簡圖如圖所示，由圖可知：a＝b＜0，c＝0，d＞0<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image21.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"175\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910074","s":"附圖的矩形ABCD中，E為<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r169.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">的中點，有一圓過C、D、E三點，且此圓分別與<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r170.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r171.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">相交於P、Q兩點。甲、乙兩人想找到此圓的圓心O，其作法如下：<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image22.png\" width=\"144\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(甲)作∠DEC的角平分線L，作<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r173.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線，交L於O點，則O即為所求<br>(乙)連接<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r174.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r175.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，兩線段交於一點O，則O即為所求<br>對於甲、乙兩人的作法，下列判斷何者正確？【105年會考】","o":["兩人皆正確","兩人皆錯誤","甲正確，乙錯誤","甲錯誤，乙正確"],"a":0,"e":"(甲)如圖(a)<br>∵<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r176.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r177.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴△DEC為等腰三角形<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r178.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">L為<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r179.svg\" width=\"26\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線<br>O為兩中垂線的交點，即O為△CDE的外心<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r180.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">O為此圓圓心<br>(乙)如圖(b)<br>∵∠ADC＝90°，∠DCB＝90°<br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r181.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r182.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">皆為此圓直徑<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r183.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r184.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">與<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r185.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的交點O為此圓圓心<br>因此甲、乙兩人皆正確<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image23.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"330\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910075","s":"如圖，正六邊形ABCDEF中，P、Q兩點分別為△ACF、△CEF的內心。若<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r187.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2，則<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r188.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">的長度為何？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image24.png\" width=\"148\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["1","2","2<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r190.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">－2","4－2<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r191.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":2,"e":"連接<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r192.svg\" width=\"23\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r193.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r194.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r195.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，可得四邊形FPCQ為箏形<br>故<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r196.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r197.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>又△ACF<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r198.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">△ECF，且皆為30°－60°－90°的直角三角形<br>故<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r199.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r200.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r201.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4<br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r202.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2×內切圓半徑＝2×<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r203.svg\" width=\"101\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2＋2<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r204.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">－4＝2<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r205.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">－2<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image25.png\" width=\"148\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910076","s":"如圖(一)，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r207.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">為一條拉直的細線，A、B兩點在<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r208.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">上，且<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r209.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r210.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1：3，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r211.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r212.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3：5。若先固定B點，將<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r213.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">摺向<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r214.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，使得<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r215.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">重疊在<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r216.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">上，如圖(二)，再從圖(二)的A點及與A點重疊處一起剪開，使得細線分成三段，則此三段細線由小到大的長度比為何？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image26.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"373\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["1：1：1","1：1：2","1：2：2","1：2：5"],"a":1,"e":"∵<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r218.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r219.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1：3＝2：6，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r220.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r221.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3：5<br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r222.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r223.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r224.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r225.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r226.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r227.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>又<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r228.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r229.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r230.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r231.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r232.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r233.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r234.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r235.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r236.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r237.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r238.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r239.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r240.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r241.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r242.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r243.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r244.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r245.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r246.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2：1：5<br>設<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r247.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2r，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r248.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝r，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r249.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5r，且圖(二)中與A點重疊處一起被剪開的點為A&#x27;（如圖所示）<br>則<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r250.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r251.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝r<br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r252.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r253.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r254.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2r：（r＋r）：（5r－r）＝2r：2r：4r＝1：1：2<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image27.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"311\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910077","s":"如圖，矩形ABCD中，M、E、F三點在<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r256.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">上，N是矩形兩對角線的交點。若<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r257.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝24，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r258.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝32，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r259.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＝16，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r260.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝8，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r261.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝7，則下列哪一條直線是A、C兩點的對稱軸？【105年會考】<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image28.png\" width=\"133\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["直線MN","直線EN","直線FN","直線DN"],"a":2,"e":"∵A、C兩點的對稱軸為<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r263.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線<br>∴連接<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r264.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，過N點作<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r265.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的垂直線<br>設此直線交<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r266.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">於P點<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r267.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r268.svg\" width=\"85\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r269.svg\" width=\"76\" alt=\"附圖\">＝40，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r270.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r271.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r272.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝20<br>∵△ABC～△PNA（AA相似）<br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r273.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r274.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r275.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r276.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r277.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">40：<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r278.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝32：20<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r279.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r280.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r281.svg\" width=\"53\" alt=\"附圖\">＝25<br>∵<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r282.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝32，<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r283.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝7<br>∴<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r284.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝32－7＝25＝<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r285.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故P點與F點重合<img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_r286.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">所求的對稱軸為直線FN<br><img src=\"img/14e3f0_y105_image29.png\" width=\"133\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["105年會考"],"d":"中","html":1}]